(7714377, 1268112, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely amazing! What an excellent shot, and what a compelling image! My first 10 given in a long time.</td>', 'This is absolutely amazing! What an excellent shot, and what a compelling image! My first 10 given in a long time.', '2022-02-13 14:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714378, 1268133, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really like this! Most of the entries don''t seem to have much to do with dark, but this is an interesting take on it. I like the halo behind the figure. I would have been tempted to do a portrait crop on it, but this crop is much more interesting. I like your choice. However, I would have put the figure off center. Moving it more to the left I think would be more effective. Nicely seen!</td>', 'I really like this! Most of the entries don''t seem to have much to do with dark, but this is an interesting take on it. I like the halo behind the figure. I would have been tempted to do a portrait crop on it, but this crop is much more interesting. I like your choice. However, I would have put the figure off center. Moving it more to the left I think would be more effective. Nicely seen!', '2022-02-13 15:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714379, 1267876, 103142, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what I think of this one. I seems too dark,  so it looks muddy, yet it''s kinda interesting. I get more interested as I look at it, but the too dark still seems to last in my mind. 6, I guess? I''ll have to look at it again later.</td>', 'I can''t tell what I think of this one. I seems too dark,  so it looks muddy, yet it''s kinda interesting. I get more interested as I look at it, but the too dark still seems to last in my mind. 6, I guess? I''ll have to look at it again later.', '2022-02-13 15:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714381, 1268103, 103142, '<td valign="top">I know it''s supposed to be dark, yet it seems too light for me. It''s a beautiful photo. I''m curious if it''s the blue tones that are bothering me. It''s so blue on the snow. What happen''s if you tone down the blue or warm up the image?</td>', 'I know it''s supposed to be dark, yet it seems too light for me. It''s a beautiful photo. I''m curious if it''s the blue tones that are bothering me. It''s so blue on the snow. What happen''s if you tone down the blue or warm up the image?', '2022-02-13 15:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714382, 1268115, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is really lovely! I wish the bottom part was just a smidge lighter. I want to have move of a hint of what''s hidden in the dark. But in my top 3 right now.</td>', 'This is really lovely! I wish the bottom part was just a smidge lighter. I want to have move of a hint of what''s hidden in the dark. But in my top 3 right now.', '2022-02-13 15:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714395, 1268115, 50641, '<td valign="top">This is an antique print on my wall.</td>', 'This is an antique print on my wall.', '2022-02-13 19:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714398, 1268115, 173844, '<td valign="top">Just enough light to meet things halfway.  We grope for the highlights and are confused, for the grain and are confounded.

<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Just enough light to meet things halfway.  We grope for the highlights and are confused, for the grain and are confounded.

Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2022-02-13 21:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714399, 1268129, 173844, '<td valign="top">Three aspects.  First the far distant that enfolds us.  Second our rectilinear humanity, and blaring lights.  Third the foreground rocks, which look to be sea creatures returning with the tide.  Terse and powerful.</td>', 'Three aspects.  First the far distant that enfolds us.  Second our rectilinear humanity, and blaring lights.  Third the foreground rocks, which look to be sea creatures returning with the tide.  Terse and powerful.', '2022-02-13 22:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714402, 1268113, 173844, '<td valign="top">You said it.  You''ve captured the grimness of the moment.  Though it''s merely life unfolding, there''s the urge to look away, whether out of respect or inability.  That they''re on a steel gray twisted wire seems implacably final.  Terrific image.</td>', 'You said it.  You''ve captured the grimness of the moment.  Though it''s merely life unfolding, there''s the urge to look away, whether out of respect or inability.  That they''re on a steel gray twisted wire seems implacably final.  Terrific image.', '2022-02-13 22:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714404, 1268116, 173844, '<td valign="top">What photography can do, capture that brief moment of near sunset and allow us to hold it up for inspection, and introspection, like a water-filled globe.  You can point to where the sun is by what''s aglow.  As I''m doing now.

<br/>An additional favorite.</td>', 'What photography can do, capture that brief moment of near sunset and allow us to hold it up for inspection, and introspection, like a water-filled globe.  You can point to where the sun is by what''s aglow.  As I''m doing now.

An additional favorite.', '2022-02-13 22:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714405, 1268142, 173844, '<td valign="top">Difficult to make out, and then you do.  A deep abundance of wonder.</td>', 'Difficult to make out, and then you do.  A deep abundance of wonder.', '2022-02-13 22:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714406, 1268096, 173844, '<td valign="top">A delicious sense of time and place.  The magic of streetlamps.  Inviting, and at the same time daring you to go on.  Brilliant wabi sabi.</td>', 'A delicious sense of time and place.  The magic of streetlamps.  Inviting, and at the same time daring you to go on.  Brilliant wabi sabi.', '2022-02-13 22:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714407, 1268118, 173844, '<td valign="top">You''ve made this plastic figure look real and threatening.  Or is it?  In any case, bravo.</td>', 'You''ve made this plastic figure look real and threatening.  Or is it?  In any case, bravo.', '2022-02-13 22:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714408, 1268133, 173844, '<td valign="top">Hearty sense of the sacred, amidst the swirling clouds of doubt.  Conjures up awe and, perhaps, trepidation.</td>', 'Hearty sense of the sacred, amidst the swirling clouds of doubt.  Conjures up awe and, perhaps, trepidation.', '2022-02-13 22:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7714409, 1268138, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the atmosphere to create atmosphere.  The full might of nature is humbling.</td>', 'Nice use of the atmosphere to create atmosphere.  The full might of nature is humbling.', '2022-02-13 22:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
