(7714434, 1268112, 103142, '<td valign="top">I would love to be able to just copy this and try the same thing. I''m starting to entry photos into juried shows at a gallery. And I think this is just smashing (hmmm -- sounding a tad English, but smashing is just the right adjective!)

<br/>
<br/>I keep thinking how I could change it up a bit, but it still seems like it would be copying it. I thought about an old, wrinkled woman''s hand coming out of the upper right and a child''s hand out of the lower left, but I''m not old or wrinkled enough, and I don''t have little kids anymore. :)

<br/>
<br/>Anyway, what a great idea and spectacularly executed!</td>', 'I would love to be able to just copy this and try the same thing. I''m starting to entry photos into juried shows at a gallery. And I think this is just smashing (hmmm -- sounding a tad English, but smashing is just the right adjective!)


I keep thinking how I could change it up a bit, but it still seems like it would be copying it. I thought about an old, wrinkled woman''s hand coming out of the upper right and a child''s hand out of the lower left, but I''m not old or wrinkled enough, and I don''t have little kids anymore. :)


Anyway, what a great idea and spectacularly executed!', '2022-02-14 12:54:16.000000', NULL, 0),
